<title>INDIA: Castrol sets 97 interim dividend.</title>
<headline>Castrol sets 97 interim dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian lubricant maker Castrol India Ltd. said on Tuesday it had set an interim dividend of 4.0 rupees per share for the first half of calendar 1997, compared to an interim dividend of 3.0 rupees per share in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>Castrol India Ltd. announced its results after market hours on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Bombay Newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
